  "title": "Clear Soup with Semolina Dumplings",
  "slug": "clear-soup-with-semolina-dumplings",
  "summary": "A traditional Austrian clear soup served with soft, handmade semolina dumplings. The dumplings are prepared from a dough of semolina, butter, and egg, then simmered until light and airy.",
